{"availability":"available","full":"shivvyas2/astra","name":"astra","description":"Astrology app that computes a real birth chart with the Swiss Ephemeris and has Claude interpret it. Next.js on Vercel, native SwiftUI iOS app, one Supabase project. Vedic kundli, dasha timeline, daily readings, push alerts, Siri and widgets.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-24T01:03:34Z","updated":"2026-10-09T23:14:56Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://astra-theta-sand.vercel.app","topics":["anthropic","astrology","claude","ios","nextjs","supabase","swiftui","swiss-ephemeris","vedic-astrology","vercel"],"demo":"https://astra-theta-sand.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T06:30:10.222Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T06:30:10.222Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T06:30:10.222Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T06:30:10.222Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An astrology app that computes a real birth chart and has Claude interpret only the computed facts. Web on Vercel, native on iOS, one API, one Supabase project.","Astrya is an astrology app that computes a person's real birth chart from their birth date, time, and place, then has Claude interpret it. It ships as a Next.js web app on Vercel and a native SwiftUI app for iOS, both backed by one API and one Supabase project.","Nothing about the chart is guessed. The Swiss Ephemeris computes planetary positions, houses, nakshatras, dashas, doshas, and transits server-side. Claude only interprets those computed values."],"features":["Chart-grounded readings. Streaming chat with an astrologer that reads the user's computed chart. Vedic (sidereal, Lahiri), Western (tropical), and numerology modes, chosen per conversation.","It remembers you. After each reading, one cheap pass keeps three kinds of memory: standing facts the user has stated about their own life (job, relationship, plans, worries), a short summary of each conversation, and a…","Kundli. The full Vedic chart as an on-screen diagram and a downloadable PDF with grahas, nakshatras, dasha periods, and numerology.","Life timeline. The user's Vimshottari dasha periods laid out as a life map, each with a plain-language theme and meaning written from their chart and the moments in it. Users pin real moments by hand, or accept moments…","Daily readings and dosha alerts. A morning and night reading per user on their local clock, plus a push notification only when a dosha or hard transit starts or ends."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shivvyas2/astra/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a3f8560bc0c12ef40902b48f4828c430d0f3ed59f508cc50bac36d8ef4051c06","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T06:30:10.444Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T06:30:10.444Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An astrology app that computes a real birth chart and has Claude interpret only the computed facts. Web on Vercel, native on iOS, one API, one Supabase project.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shivvyas2/astra/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Email plus six-digit code, and Sign in with Apple.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shivvyas2/astra/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"An isolated admin area with its own login for reading user transcripts.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shivvyas2/astra/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"optional","text":"Astrya Plus is an optional App Store subscription that gates nothing.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shivvyas2/astra/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"a3f8560bc0c12ef40902b48f4828c430d0f3ed59f508cc50bac36d8ef4051c06","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shivvyas2/astra/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T06:30:10.445Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T23:14:56Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https